                                    <h1>Best D2C Marketing Agency for Electronics Brands India 2026 &mdash; Tech Reviewer Outreach, Amazon DSP &amp; Comparison SEO</h1>

                                    <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> For D2C electronics brands in 2026, the right agency leads with <strong>tech reviewer + YouTube outreach</strong> (30&ndash;60 reviewers per launch &mdash; drives 25&ndash;45% of new-customer CAC reduction), <strong>Amazon DSP + Sponsored Brands</strong> (Amazon is 55&ndash;75% of category), <strong>comparison content SEO</strong> (&lsquo;[brand A] vs [brand B]&rsquo; queries), and <strong>warranty + support trust signals</strong> prominently on PDP. Retainers <strong>&#8377;1.5L&ndash;&#8377;6L/month + ad spend</strong>, blended ROAS <strong>4&times;&ndash;7&times;</strong>. Biggest red flag: an agency that doesn&rsquo;t do tech reviewer outreach.</p>
                                    <p>This is the picking guide we give D2C electronics founders evaluating marketing agencies in 2026. We&rsquo;ve scaled D2C wearables, audio, smart home, appliance and accessory brands &mdash; with tech reviewer outreach, comparison content, Amazon DSP + own-site dual play, and post-purchase accessory + refresh cycles. No generic D2C advice. Real ranges, 12 questions, four honest red flags.</p>

